hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"20874","Abd al-Samad narrated to us, Umar ibn Farrukh narrated to me, Bistam narrated to me, from a Bedouin who was their guest, that he prayed with the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and he gave two salutations."
"20875","Abu Sa'id narrated to us, Umar ibn Farrukh narrated to us, Bistam al-Kufi narrated to us, he said: A Bedouin was our guest, so the Bedouin narrated from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) that he prayed with the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and he gave two salutations, on his right and on his left."
